      "value": "Funnily enough, this same bug also occurred in the View Reports UI which was tracked as a bug, removed in Build `1860`, and then forgotten.\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/could-not-download-world-photo-thumbnail-from-reports-user-interface-but-its-ava\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/view-reports-ui-shows-the-first-uploaded-version-of-a-photo-of-content-instead-o (Tracked)",
