  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The product image when buying an avatar shows the original image that was used when uploading the avatar, NOT the current thumbnail. This means it shows the WIP thumbnail that is INNACCURATE to the final avatar, especially when the avatar was different in testing/the first upload and a final thumbnail wasn't already made by the time the first upload was tested.",
